{
  "caveats": [
    "Output is in metric tonnes, fleet size in boats and fishers in people; these measures cannot be added together. Published totals overlap their components. Active-fisher counts do not measure hours worked or fishing income. National aggregates do not describe landing sites, districts, fish stocks or sustainability. The source’s 2023 total for active fishers exceeds the sum of its marine and inland counts by 280 people; all three published figures are retained.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
